> Oracle IL[OM] CLI shell (default) – The Oracle ILOM[ shell] provides access[ to] Oracle ILOM's features and functions through a CLI.
Oracle ILOM web interface – The Oracle ILOM web interface supports the same[ set] of features and functions as the[ shell].
